AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0000035 "Obsoleted 2026-09-22. The Centre National de Génotypage is a French genotyping and sequencing centre, not a participant cohort. Its only hit in an EBI database is a text match of the acronym CNG to EGA study EGAS00001001825 (Institut Curie - CNG neuroblastoma whole-genome sequencing), which the human EGA review marked incorrect, and the GWAS Catalog has no CNG cohort tag. No cohort was identified for the term to be replaced by."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0000035 "obsolete Centre National de Génotypage"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0000035 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

