AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0000135 "Obsoleted 2026-09-22. No study of this name could be identified. Its only hit in an EBI database is a text match of the acronym OCS to EGA study EGAS00001006555 (ovarian carcinosarcoma genomics), where OCS abbreviates ovarian carcinosarcoma; the human EGA review marked the match incorrect, and the GWAS Catalog has no OCS cohort tag. No cohort was identified for the term to be replaced by."@en)
